Vibration motor (negronihap=1): PM8350B HV haptics direct play over SPMI, a 300 ms buzz at boot as
the proof, and the kernel API negroni_haptic_play(ms, strength) (bsd/dev/negroni_haptic.h).
Details: docs/haptics-plan.md.

